releases.summary:
Tour beautiful places and dance the Sardana with the hidden cats of Barcelona!

It's time to have a snack at a local Churreria and take a long stroll through Park Güell, because the Hidden Cats have arrived in ever beautiful and sunny Cat-alonia!

The nooks and crannies of Barcelona hide many adorable furballs... Can you spot them all?

On your trip you can - of course - count on:
- 8 beautiful, hand-drawn, real life-inspired levels;
- 800+ hidden cats and objects to spot;
- NEW! Colouring Mode Selection with progressive color reveal for found objects and areas;
- Collectible cards and secrets!
